	"data": "AR Glasses Market Comparison — September 2026\n\nCompiled for Chris, prioritizing display quality for tethered use with Star (RTX 3070 Ti, Arch Linux, 3x DP/HDMI monitors, no USB-C DP Alt Mode). Updated with RayNeo GT Max IFA launch details.\n\nThe Market Right Now\n\nConsumer AR glasses in 2026 fall into two categories:\nDisplay glasses — dumb screens that receive video over USB-C DisplayPort Alt Mode. Micro-OLED panels, 1080p–1200p per eye, 120Hz. No computing onboard. Lightweight (68–88g). This is…",
